WEBVTT

00:28:27.829 --> 00:28:33.954
And so in Damini, who had never met,
we wrote that outline.

00:28:34.329 --> 00:28:38.496
It was in a week based on
just pure instinct.

00:28:38.496 --> 00:28:42.663
And we went off and we shot this to our
pilot that we were, you know, writing,

00:28:42.663 --> 00:28:46.246
casting, shooting, doing post and
everything in nine weeks.

00:28:46.246 --> 00:28:52.246
And it was a crazy crunched period. Wow.
And it ended up working as a pilot.

00:28:52.246 --> 00:28:56.621
And then Damon and Carlton
Cuse wrote the series.

00:28:56.621 --> 00:29:03.246
But I, I feel like it's one of those
lessons that not having an ending,